  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/DSC4303.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(20 fotos) L&#39;alumnat i el professorat de l&#39;IES Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave;, a Onda, ha protagonitzat aquest dijous al pati central de l&#39;institut un acte contra la LGTBIfobia. Despr&eacute;s de llegir-se un manifest, s&#39;ha disparat una mascletada de globus perqu&egrave; acaben totes les discriminacions i per la diversitat.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acteiesserraespadacontralgtbifobia/dsc4301.jpg\" alt=\"dsc4301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acteiesserraespadacontralgtbifobia/dsc4302.jpg\" alt=\"dsc4302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acteiesserraespadacontralgtbifobia/dsc4303.jpg\" alt=\"dsc4303\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acteiesserraespadacontralgtbifobia/dsc4304.jpg\" alt=\"dsc4304\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acteiesserraespadacontralgtbifobia/dsc4305.jpg\" alt=\"dsc4305\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acteiesserraespadacontralgtbifobia/dsc4306.jpg\" alt=\"dsc4306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acteiesserraespadacontralgtbifobia/dsc4307.jpg\" alt=\"dsc4307\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acteiesserraespadacontralgtbifobia/dsc4308.jpg\" alt=\"dsc4308\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ac